      "note": "The rule was spelled in the .mid reader, the .chart reader and the Preview's gem_of. The .chart reader's old copy split the two tests across two lines, which the first two forms cannot see; the third example is that copy on one line, and the third form of the pattern catches its second line (the fourth example) on its own. Asking allows_cymbals alone is fine: that is which pads can carry a cymbal, a different question. Decided by: D115, plan part B1, task B1-3"
